{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" datamodel=\"ecmascript\">\n  <datamodel><data id=\"x\" expr=\"0\"/></datamodel>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml067-no-states.scx"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":1,"notes":0,"total":1,"warnings":0},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml067-no-states.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":7,"endLine":1,"startColumn":2,"startLine":1}}}],"message":{"markdown":"`<scxml>` has no states\n\n**Note:** a machine starts by entering its initial state, so without a `<state>`, `<parallel>`, or `<final>` child there is nothing to run\n\n**Help:** add the machine's states, for example `<final id=\"done\"/>`\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §3.2 <scxml>","text":"`<scxml>` has no states"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":6,"start":1},"category":"semantic"},"ruleId":"SCXML067"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"SCXML 1.0 §3.2.2: \"A conformant SCXML document MUST have at least one <state>, <parallel> or <final> child\"; a machine starts by entering its initial state, so with none there is nothing to enter"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: add the machine's states, for example `<final id=\"done\"/>`.\n\nSpecification: SCXML 1.0 §3.2 <scxml>\n\nRun `scx --explain SCXML067` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/#scxml","id":"SCXML067","name":"SCXML067","properties":{"category":"semantic"},"shortDescription":{"text":"an `<scxml>` has no child states"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}